@startuml
title 360-Degree Performance Evaluation & Strategic Goals/OKR Calibration Workflow

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #0f172a
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #f8fafc
skinparam ActivityFontColor #0f172a
skinparam ActivityFontSize 12
skinparam ActivityFontStyle bold

skinparam SwimlaneBorderColor #1d4ed8
skinparam SwimlaneWidth 230
skinparam SwimlaneTitleFontColor #1e3a8a
skinparam SwimlaneTitleFontSize 14
skinparam SwimlaneTitleFontStyle bold

skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.5

|HR Manager|
start
:Initialize Annual 360 Performance Review Campaign;
:Configure Competency Rating Grids & Evaluation Weights;

|Department Manager|
:Define Department Strategic Objectives & OKRs;
:Cascade Goals & Link Individual Key Results to Team;

|Employee|
:Log Monthly Progress Updates on Key Results;
:Complete Self-Appraisal Form & Accomplishment List;
:Submit Peer Appraisal Feedback for Assigned Colleagues;

|Department Manager|
:Review Employee Self-Appraisal & Peer Feedback;
:Schedule 1-on-1 Performance Coaching Session;
:Conduct 1-on-1 Review & Discuss Accomplishments;
:Score Employee Performance Competencies;
:Submit Manager Evaluation & Rating Recommendation;

|HR Manager|
:Conduct Company-wide Performance Calibration Meeting;
:Review Overall Rating Distribution Curve;
if (Calibration Balanced?) then (Approved)
  :Finalize Performance Scores & Merit Increases;
else (Outlier)
  :Adjust Manager Rating with Justification;
endif

|HR Manager|
:Approve Performance Bonus Allocations & Kudos Points;
:Publish Official Appraisal Results to Employees;

|Employee|
:View Final Performance Scorecard & Feedback;
:Accept Bonus Allocation & Peer Kudos Points;
:Update Individual Development Plan (IDP) for Next Cycle;
stop
@enduml
